<title>FINLAND: UPM-Kymmene 1996 sales, profit by division.</title>
<headline>UPM-Kymmene 1996 sales, profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>UPM-Kymmene Oy on Tuesday published the following breakdown its 1996 net sales and operating profit (million markka):</p>
<p> NET SALES:			1996		 1995</p>
<p> Magazine papers		11,172	     12,322</p>
<p> Newsprint			 5,780		5,676</p>
<p> Fine papers		     6,220		7,140</p>
<p> Packaging materials	   5,473		5,728</p>
<p> Sawn timber		     3,725		3,773</p>
<p> Plywood			   3,144		3,084</p>
<p> Special products		3,574		3,528</p>
<p> Chemical pulp		   4,106		6,070</p>
<p> Other			    10,525	     11,344</p>
<p> Engineering (Rauma)	  10,220		9,837</p>
<p> Internal sales		-12,182	    -13,764</p>
<p> TOTAL			    51,757	     54,738</p>
<p>OPERATING PROFIT:</p>
<p> Magazine papers		 2,072		2,803</p>
<p> Newsprint			 1,044		  969</p>
<p> Fine papers			  85		  719</p>
<p> Packaging materials	     559		  362</p>
<p> Sawn timber		   loss 48		  135 profit</p>
<p> Plywood			     139		   25</p>
<p> Special products		  339		  364</p>
<p> Chemical pulp (1)	  loss 176		2,228 profit</p>
<p> Other				 867		  157</p>
<p> Engineering (Rauma)	     710		  742</p>
<p> TOTAL			     5,591		8,504</p>
<p>NOTE -- (1) Includes share of results of associated companies</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
